Meta.documentation:httpConnection
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:One accepted HTTP request, as a resource: it holds the req/res pair
Meta.documentation:from the acceptor's handle (the connection's own edge, the way file:
Meta.documentation:holds its path) plus the request meta on .value ({method,url,headers}
Meta.documentation:- so match: and Data.get: can dig it).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:  in_go            - presents the request to the pipe: emits the request
Meta.documentation:                     meta on out_request_headers (the connection starts
Meta.documentation:                     the processing pipe when it is triggered)
Meta.documentation:  in_response_$all - replies to res: the payload streams in, the
Meta.documentation:                     connection writes the wire
Meta.documentation:  in_end           - request end reached the connection through the flow:
Meta.documentation:                     a handler that stayed silent is answered the
Meta.documentation:                     default (204 routed-but-silent) after a short grace
Meta.documentation:                     window, so async repliers (the via mount's file
Meta.documentation:                     load) land first
Meta.documentation:{__dawnResponse:{status,contentType,headers,body}} is sent verbatim.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_response_$all - the reply streams in; the connection writes its res
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_headers - the request meta, emitted on in_go
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_$all - reply sink for String values (replies to res)
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all - reply sink for Number values (replies to res)
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_$all - reply sink for Boolean values (replies to res)
Meta.documentation:@port in_Data_$all - reply sink for Data values (replies to res)
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_$all - reply sink for raw bytes (replies to res)
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_octetstream - body fallback (late-connect, not yet fired)
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_String - String body (late-connect, not yet fired)
Meta.documentation:@port out_request_Data - Data body (late-connect, not yet fired)
Meta.documentation:@see httpServer
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20httpConnection%3A%20%E2%80%94%20one%20accepted%20HTTP%20request%20as%20a%20resource.%20It%20holds%20the%0A%2F%2F%20req%2Fres%20pair%20from%20the%20acceptor's%20handle%20(the%20connection's%20own%20edge%2C%20the%0A%2F%2F%20way%20file%3A%20holds%20its%20path)%20plus%20the%20request%20meta%20on%20.value.%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20in_go%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20presents%20the%20request%20to%20the%20pipe%3A%20emits%20the%20request%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20meta%20on%20out_request_headers%20(the%20connection%20starts%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20the%20processing%20pipe%20when%20it%20is%20triggered)%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20in_response_%24all%20%20-%20replies%20to%20res%3A%20the%20payload%20streams%20in%2C%20the%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20connection%20writes%20the%20wire%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20in_end%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20request%20end%20reached%20the%20connection%20through%20the%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20flow%3A%20a%20handler%20that%20stayed%20silent%20is%20answered%20the%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20default%20(204%20routed-but-silent)%20after%20a%20short%20grace%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20window%2C%20so%20async%20repliers%20(the%20via%20mount's%20file%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20load)%20land%20first%0A%2F%2F%20%7B__dawnResponse%3A%7Bstatus%2CcontentType%2Cheaders%2Cbody%7D%7D%20is%20sent%20verbatim.%0Afunction%20httpConnection()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22httpConnection%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20httpConnectionProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20httpConnectionProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09resource.answered%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20future%3A%20body%20ports%20fire%20on%20late-connect%20(when%20the%20handler%20binds%20them)%0A%09this.out_request_octetstream%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_request_String%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_request_Data%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20.go%20%E2%80%94%20present%20the%20request%20to%20the%20pipe%0A%09this.out_request_headers%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_go%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(resource.value)%20this.out_request_headers%3F.(%7B%20value%3A%20resource.value%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20reply%3A%20streams%20in%2C%20the%20connection%20writes%20its%20own%20res%0A%09this.in_response_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(resource.answered%20%7C%7C%20!resource.res)%20return%3B%0A%09%09resource.answered%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09respond(resource.res%2C%20(input%20%26%26%20input.get_resource)%20%3F%20input%20%3A%20((input%20%26%26%20input.value%20!%3D%3D%20undefined)%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20input)%2C%20200)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20request%20end%20through%20the%20flow%3A%20default-answer%20silent%20handlers%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(resource.answered%20%7C%7C%20!resource.res)%20return%3B%0A%09%09setTimeout(function()%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(resource.answered%20%7C%7C%20!resource.res)%20return%3B%0A%09%09%09resource.answered%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09%09respond(resource.res%2C%20undefined%2C%20resource.defaultStatus%20%7C%7C%20204)%3B%0A%09%09%7D%2C%20100)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20reply%20arrives%20on%20ANY%20value%20port%20-%20the%20connection%20is%20the%20reply%20sink%0A%09%2F%2F%20for%20every%20type%20(a%20fetched%20image%20lands%20as%20octetstream%2C%20fetched%20text%20as%0A%09%2F%2F%20String%2C%20json%20as%20Data%2C%20...)%3B%20all%20of%20them%20reply%20to%20res%0A%09this.in_String_%24all%20%3D%20this.in_response_%24all%3B%0A%09this.in_Number_%24all%20%3D%20this.in_response_%24all%3B%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20Boolean%20reply%20is%20the%20SUCCESS%20pattern%20(e.g.%20file%3A's%20out_Boolean_success)%3A%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20http%20layer%20translates%20it%20-%20true%20-%3E%20200%20%22OK%22%2C%20false%20-%3E%20500%20%22false%22%0A%09this.in_Boolean_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(resource.answered%20%7C%7C%20!resource.res)%20return%3B%0A%09%09resource.answered%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09const%20v%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.get_resource)%20%3F%20input.get_resource().value%20%3A%20((input%20%26%26%20input.value%20!%3D%3D%20undefined)%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20input)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(v)%20send(resource.res%2C%20200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20%22OK%22)%3B%0A%09%09else%20send(resource.res%2C%20500%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20%22false%22)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_Data_%24all%20%3D%20this.in_response_%24all%3B%0A%09this.in_octetstream_%24all%20%3D%20this.in_response_%24all%3B%0A%09%2F%2F%20an%20error%20arriving%20at%20the%20connection%20replies%20the%20wire%3A%20strings%20are%20plain%0A%09%2F%2F%20messages%20(their%20status%20or%20404)%2C%20objects%20are%20JSON%20errors%20(404%20unless%20a%0A%09%2F%2F%20status%20rides%20along)%20-%20the%20reference%20server's%20file-route%20behavior%0A%09this.in_error%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(resource.answered%20%7C%7C%20!resource.res)%20return%3B%0A%09%09resource.answered%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09const%20v%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.value%20!%3D%3D%20undefined)%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20input%3B%0A%09%09const%20status%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.status)%20%7C%7C%20404%3B%0A%09%09const%20isMsg%20%3D%20typeof%20v%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22string%22%3B%0A%09%09send(resource.res%2C%20status%2C%20isMsg%20%3F%20%22text%2Fplain%22%20%3A%20%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%20isMsg%20%3F%20v%20%3A%20JSON.stringify(v))%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09return%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%20reply%20writing%3A%20typed%20resources%20by%20name%2FcontentType%2C%20%7Bvalue%3A...%7D%20wrappers%0A%2F%2F%20unwrapped%2C%20%7B__dawnResponse%3A%7Bstatus%2CcontentType%2Cheaders%2Cbody%7D%7D%20verbatim%0Afunction%20respond(res%2C%20reply%2C%20status)%0A%7B%0A%09if%20(reply%20%3D%3D%3D%20undefined%20%7C%7C%20reply%20%3D%3D%3D%20null)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09res.statusCode%20%3D%20status%20%7C%7C%20204%3B%0A%09%09res.end()%3B%0A%09%09return%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09if%20(reply.get_resource)%20%2F%2F%20a%20resource%3A%20cast%20by%20its%20type%20name%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09const%20r%20%3D%20reply.get_resource()%3B%0A%09%09const%20v%20%3D%20r.value%3B%0A%09%09if%20(r.contentType)%20%2F%2F%20the%20true%20content-type%20wins%20(cast%20stamps%20it%20on%20loaded%20values)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(v%20instanceof%20Uint8Array)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20r.contentType%2C%20Buffer.from(v))%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Data%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22List%22)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20r.contentType%2C%20JSON.stringify(v%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20v%20%3A%20(r.elements%20%7C%7C%20%5B%5D)))%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20r.contentType%2C%20String(v))%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22String%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Number%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Boolean%22)%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20String(v))%3B%0A%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22Data%22%20%7C%7C%20r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22List%22)%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%20JSON.stringify(v%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20v%20%3A%20(r.elements%20%7C%7C%20%5B%5D)))%3B%0A%09%09if%20(r.name%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22octetstream%22)%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Foctet-stream%22%2C%20Buffer.from(v%20instanceof%20Uint8Array%20%3F%20v%20%3A%20new%20Uint8Array(0)))%3B%0A%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20String(v))%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09switch%20(typeof%20reply)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09case%20%22string%22%3A%20%20return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20reply)%3B%0A%09%09case%20%22number%22%3A%0A%09%09case%20%22boolean%22%3A%20return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20String(reply))%3B%0A%09%09case%20%22object%22%3A%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20verbatim%20escape%20hatch%3A%20%7B__dawnResponse%3A%7Bstatus%2CcontentType%2Cheaders%2Cbody%7D%7D%0A%09%09%09if%20(reply%20%26%26%20reply.__dawnResponse)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09const%20r%20%3D%20reply.__dawnResponse%3B%0A%09%09%09%09if%20(r.headers)%20for%20(const%20k%20of%20Object.keys(r.headers))%20res.setHeader(k%2C%20r.headers%5Bk%5D)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09const%20body%20%3D%20r.body%20%3D%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20%22%22%20%3A%20(r.body%20instanceof%20Uint8Array%20%3F%20Buffer.from(r.body)%20%3A%20String(r.body))%3B%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20r.status%20%7C%7C%20200%2C%20r.contentType%20%7C%7C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20body)%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%09if%20(reply%20instanceof%20Uint8Array)%0A%09%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Foctet-stream%22%2C%20Buffer.from(reply))%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C200%2C%20%22application%2Fjson%22%2C%20JSON.stringify(reply))%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%09return%20send(res%2C%20status%7C%7C204%2C%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20%22%22)%3B%0A%7D%0Afunction%20send(res%2C%20status%2C%20contentType%2C%20body)%0A%7B%0A%09res.statusCode%20%3D%20status%3B%0A%09res.setHeader(%22content-type%22%2C%20contentType)%3B%0A%09res.setHeader(%22Content-Security-Policy%22%2C%20CSP_HEADER)%3B%0A%09res.setHeader(%22Access-Control-Allow-Origin%22%2C%20%22*%22)%3B%0A%09res.end(body)%3B%0A%7D%0Aconst%20CSP_HEADER%20%3D%20%22default-src%20*%20'unsafe-eval'%20'unsafe-inline'%20data%3A%20blob%3A%3B%20script-src%20*%20'unsafe-eval'%20'unsafe-inline'%3B%20style-src%20*%20'unsafe-inline'%3B%20img-src%20*%20data%3A%20blob%3A%3B%20font-src%20*%20data%3A%20blob%3A%3B%22%3B%0AhttpConnection.Processor%3DhttpConnectionProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%20%3D%20httpConnection%3B%0A]>>NewResource:httpConnection
